  echo http://127.0.0.1:8080/
{{- end }}

{{- else if .Values.ingress.enabled }}

Ingress is enabled. Open the host configured in values.yaml (ingress.hosts).

{{- end }}

Next steps:
  1. Open the UI and complete the welcome wizard (model, agent, tools).
  2. Mount capas if not already: set backend.capas.hostPath or backend.capas.existingClaim.
  3. For production: set oc8.env=prod and restrict network access to dev-login.

Health check:
  kubectl exec --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} deploy/{{ include "oc8.fullname" . }}-backend -- python -c "import urllib.request; print(urllib.request.urlopen('http://127.0.0.1:8099/health').read())"

Documentation:
  https://docs.oc8.io/user/quickstart
</file>

